  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YUBAP-KS Partnership Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservative Students are planning a partner identification trip to Armenia in the summer 2023, where we will meet with the Youth Union of Bright Armenia Party. Both of our organisations work for the young people in our countries and strives to empower the youth, in order to improve the daily life for young people, both on a short term and on a long term basis. The fight for freedom of speech, freedom of research and freedom of thoughts are essential for both organisations. This partner identification troup should lay the foundation for a long lasting cooperation between our two organisations, which will strengthen both in the future.</narrative>
  </description>
